{"skill":{"slug":"gemini-deep-research","displayName":"Gemini Deep Research"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768845281114,"changelog":"Initial release: Complex research tasks via Gemini Deep Research Agent","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2289,"sha256":"a137cd745e58300e43f7a2787dd256a33fbe1d8144ae75ac5154f80b6a903357","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/deep_research.py","size":5686,"sha256":"1d39ec3f50e549f1c989a370eb00438d52b6d9ce4e77c4a01b315b3f6420ba7a","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2143,"sha256":"bd09fe3502e6e42d41547eebd1fb8058e56c945ddccfbc7e75aded20dd091816","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789016672684,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b53c2e435897f771f3c7a9711ebc91e570c242d8692570e9a4c42d8f0d5ecbc0","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b53c2e435897f771f3c7a9711ebc91e570c242d8692570e9a4c42d8f0d5ecbc0","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: gemini-deep-research\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill is designed to interact with the Gemini Deep Research API for complex research tasks. It correctly handles the `GEMINI_API_KEY` by reading it from environment variables or CLI arguments and uses it to authenticate with the legitimate Google API endpoint (`generativelanguage.googleapis.com`). The script saves research reports locally to user-specified or default directories, which is a core function. There is no evidence of unauthorized data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, prompt injection attempts against the OpenClaw agent, or obfuscation. All observed behaviors are aligned with the stated purpose.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159798894},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":96,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":6,"checkedAt":1789016672684},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Gemini Deep Research client that sends user research requests to Google's API and saves the returned report locally.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Use of GEMINI_API_KEY and network access to generativelanguage.googleapis.com is proportionate to the stated Gemini API purpose; optional file-search store use could expose user-selected stored content to the provider.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact contains a SKILL.md and one local Python helper script; I found no install hooks, dependency installers, remote payload retrieval, or tool modification.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are narrow and operational, though the skill does not provide a dedicated privacy warning beyond documenting the API endpoint, auth header, file-search option, and full metadata output.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The script creates an output directory and writes timestamped Markdown and JSON result files, including full interaction metadata; this is disclosed in the skill but users should treat those files as potentially sensitive.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The documented purpose is deep research using Gemini, and the script's behavior matches that purpose: it creates a Google API interaction, polls for completion, extracts a report, and prints/saves it.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable sending research prompts and any selected file-search context to Google's Gemini API. Do not use it with secrets, regulated data, or confidential business material unless that data is approved for this provider, and protect or delete the generated JSON metadata files when they may contain sensitive content.","findings":"[TT3] expected: The scanner's tainted-flow concern appears overstated: interaction_id is read from the Google API response, not from the environment, and the GET request uses the same documented Google API endpoint with the API key header required for polling.\n[LP3] expected: The artifact does not declare a formal permission scope, but it does disclose the required GEMINI_API_KEY, endpoint, authentication method, output files, and optional file-search usage.\n[SQP-2] expected: Queries, output-format instructions, and optional file-search store names are sent to Google's Gemini API as core functionality; the absence of a stronger privacy warning is guidance-worthy but not evidence of hidden or mismatched behavior.\n[E1] expected: External transmission is to the documented Google Generative Language API endpoint and is necessary for the skill's stated research capability.\n[SQP-2] expected: Local persistence of the report and raw JSON metadata is disclosed in SKILL.md and implemented plainly in the script; users should choose the output directory carefully.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789016672684}}}}}